(1. PROCEDURAL BACKGROUND & FACTS) '
(This appeal arises from the final judgment and order passed by the High Court in respect of statutory proceedings.) '
T*
(2. STATUTORY FRAMEWORK & ISSUES) '
(The primary legal issue for determination is whether the administrative authority complied with mandatory procedural safeguards under:) '
(- Income Tax Act, 1961 \(Section 148, Section 148A\)) '
(- Finance Act, 2021) '
ET
